---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About, Glen Hutajulu"
  description="I'm Glen Hutajulu, a product designer based in Jakarta. I've spent 3+ years designing enterprise products across telco, banking and consumer finance."
>
  <div class="wrap">

    <section class="about-head">
      <h1 class="h-statement">i'm glen hutajulu, a product designer based in jakarta. i've spent 3+ years designing enterprise products across telco, banking and consumer finance.</h1>
    </section>

    <section class="about-grid">
      <img class="crop crop-center ratio-4-5" src="/img/about-portrait.webp" alt="Portrait of Glen Hutajulu, arms crossed, wearing a navy overshirt" width="960" height="1200" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high">
      <div class="about-text">
        <div class="about-body">
          <p>Most recently I was the sole designer on an LLM-powered analytics platform. Before that I worked at Aleph, a Singapore-HQ creative technology agency, on products for FIFGROUP and Telkomsel.</p>
          <p>I own the work end to end: research, flows, high-fidelity UI, usability testing and handoff. Claude is part of my daily workflow for documentation, ideation and faster iteration.</p>
          <p>Outside design, I co-own a record store in South Jakarta, where I handle operations and finance.</p>
        </div>
        <p class="label mt-label">Experience</p>
        <ul class="about-list mt-10">
          <li class="mt-4">freelance, product and web designer, <span class="nowrap">2024–present</span></li><li class="mt-4">technova integrasi solusi, senior ui/ux designer, <span class="nowrap">2025–2026</span></li>

          <li class="mt-4">aleph, ui/ux designer, <span class="nowrap">2023–2024</span></li>
          <li class="mt-4">byu, internship, <span class="nowrap">2022–2023</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>
</Base>
